            {
              "id": "465dbf47-debc-4095-be31-2512777abdd3",
              "text": "[证明] Filter.sets",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "2626c901-162b-4cc3-88a7-f06169f12033",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Order.Filter.Defs`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u_1} → Filter α → Set (Set α)\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe set of sets that belong to the filter.",
