            {
              "id": "4a0864bf-5cdc-4c32-a17b-194ea431d93f",
              "text": "布尔代数",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "4aaec705-87a9-4dc9-822b-79bc57f8a228",
                  "text": "[证明] BooleanAlgebra",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "4a0864bf-5cdc-4c32-a17b-194ea431d93f",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Order.BooleanAlgebra.Defs`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nType u → Type u\n```\n\n**文档**\nA Boolean algebra is a bounded distributive lattice with a complement operator `ᶜ` such that\n`x ⊓ xᶜ = ⊥` and `x ⊔ xᶜ = ⊤`. For convenience, it must also provide a set difference operation `\\`\nand a Heyting implication `⇨` satisfying `x \\ y = x ⊓ yᶜ` and `x ⇨ y = y ⊔ xᶜ`.\n\nThis is a generalization of (classical) logic of propositions, or the powerset lattice.\n\nSince `BoundedOrder`, `OrderBot`, and `OrderTop` are mixins that require `LE`\nto be present at define-time, the `extends` mechanism does not work with them.\nInstead, we extend using the underlying `Bot` and `Top` data typeclasses, and replicate the\norder axioms of those classes here. A \"forgetful\" instance back to `BoundedOrder` is provided.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "inductive"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "46e73aef-04e8-4a5e-9424-3d54540da150",
                  "text": "[证明] BooleanAlgebra.mk",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "4a0864bf-5cdc-4c32-a17b-194ea431d93f",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Order.BooleanAlgebra.Defs`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → [toDistribLattice : DistribLattice α] → [toCompl : Compl α] → [toSDiff : SDiff α] → [toHImp : HImp α] → [toTop : Top α] → [toBot : Bot α] → (∀ (x : α), x ⊓ xᶜ ≤ ⊥) → (∀ (x : α), ⊤ ≤ x ⊔ xᶜ) → (∀ (a : α), a ≤ ⊤) → (∀ (a : α), ⊥ ≤ a) → autoParam (∀ (x y : α), x \\ y = x ⊓ yᶜ) BooleanAlgebra.sdiff_eq._autoParam → autoParam (∀ (x y : α), x ⇨ y = y ⊔ xᶜ) BooleanAlgebra.himp_eq._autoParam → BooleanAlgebra α\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "constructor"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ac5fcc5f-365f-4b41-b460-f0a44848bb3b",
                  "text": "[证明] BooleanAlgebra.toCompl",
                  "children": [],
