                  "parentId": "4a0864bf-5cdc-4c32-a17b-194ea431d93f",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Order.BooleanAlgebra.Defs`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → [self : BooleanAlgebra α] → Compl α\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "definition"
                    ]
