                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Logic.Function.Basic`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u} {f : α → α}, Function.Involutive f → Function.Surjective f\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
