                {
                  "id": "d7e83cbb-1325-4847-a90d-8acef369c851",
                  "text": "[证明] Function.Surjective",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "fdd05923-443b-4612-bb3d-adb85d91c683",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Data.Function`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Sort u_1} → {β : Sort u_2} → (α → β) → Prop\n```\n\n**文档**\nA function `f : α → β` is called surjective if every `b : β` is equal to `f a`\nfor some `a : α`.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "definition"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
