                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "9da7d171-c6de-4792-90a5-39f26214de05",
                  "text": "[证明] Function.Surjective.forall",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "fdd05923-443b-4612-bb3d-adb85d91c683",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Logic.Function.Basic`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u_1} {β : Sort u_2} {f : α → β}, Function.Surjective f → ∀ {p : β → Prop}, (∀ (y : β), p y) ↔ ∀ (x : α), p (f x)\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
