                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 内部\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Logic.Function.Basic`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u_1} {β : Sort u_2} {f : α → β} (y : β) (motive : (∃ a, f a = y) → Prop) (x : ∃ a, f a = y), (∀ (x : α) (hx : f x = y), motive ⋯) → motive x\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）\n\n**说明** equation compiler / recursor / match 管道，默认折叠。",
